#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:1092
msgid "Such messages may be helpful, when you create bug reports (or trying to find a bug by yourself)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:1095
